/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F11%2F93%2F2cc2e4644cb7b064d3328a825f6e%2F2026-09-26-nso-gala-079-jpg-fix.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5616x3159+0+293/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F11%2F93%2F2cc2e4644cb7b064d3328a825f6e%2F2026-09-26-nso-gala-079-jpg-fix.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5616x3159+0+293/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F11%2F93%2F2cc2e4644cb7b064d3328a825f6e%2F2026-09-26-nso-gala-079-jpg-fix.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5616x3159+0+293/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F11%2F93%2F2cc2e4644cb7b064d3328a825f6e%2F2026-09-26-nso-gala-079-jpg-fix.jpg" class="img" alt="The National Symphony Orchestra opens its 2026 season at Strathmore with Music Director Gianandrea Noseda conducting a vibrant program featuring Tchaikovsky’s Swan Lake Suite, Carlos Simon’s Monuments: A Suite for DC, and Respighi’s La boutique fantasque. Photos capture the September 26, 2026 gala concert at the Music Center at Strathmore in North Bethesda, Maryland." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 The National Symphony Orchestra opens its 2026 season at Strathmore with Music Director Gianandrea Noseda conducting a vibrant program featuring Tchaikovsky's Swan Lake Suite, Carlos Simon's Monuments: A Suite for DC, and Respighi's La boutique fantasque. Photos capture the September 26, 2026 gala concert at the Music Center at Strathmore in North Bethesda, Maryland.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Photo by Scott Suchman-NSO/KC1CT22                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;The National Symphony Orchestra is currently without a home while its Kennedy Center venue is involved in a federal court dispute. The NSO &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/01/nx-s1-6005501/national-symphony-orchestra-kennedy-center" target="_blank"&gt;faced a new reality&lt;/a&gt; when it had to find six alternative concert venues in the Washington, D.C., area while hoping to maintain its budget amid ongoing controversies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;After entertaining visitors for decades at the St. Louis Zoo, Raja, a 10,000-pound Asian elephant, has &lt;a href="https://www.stlpr.org/news-briefs/2026-10-30/raja-elephant-arrives-cincinnati-zoo?utm_source=npr.org&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=national_highlight&amp;utm_content=homepage" target="_blank"&gt;moved to new stomping grounds&lt;/a&gt; at the Cincinnati Zoo and Botanical Garden. (via &lt;a href="https://www.stlpr.org/" target="_blank"&gt;STLPR&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Commonwealth of Virginia and the District of Columbia have &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/31/nx-s1-6024694/virginia-dc-sue-trump-arch" target="_blank"&gt;filed a lawsuit to stop&lt;/a&gt; the construction of Trump's proposed 250-foot-tall triumphal arch.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/859721331/suzanne-nuyen"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Suzanne Nuyen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
